{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of Lost Jelly Remaster \u2014 an arcade adventure with a brand new flavor!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alien spaceship filled with adorable Jelly creatures crashes on Earth after a malfunction in its engine. In panic, the Jelly scatter across nearby farms, and now they must be gathered quickly before the ship is repaired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Nimble \u2014 an old but experienced collector robot. He used to handle this job perfectly back on his home planet\u2026 until his brakes broke. Now he can only move forward \u2014 and the rest is up to you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Arcade meets puzzle</strong> \u2014 Each level demands precise planning, like chess at high speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Unique protagonist</strong> \u2014 Nimble collects Jelly and drags an ever-growing tail of boxes behind him, like a classic snake game with a twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Handcrafted levels</strong> \u2014 Every stage is built manually and offers a fresh challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10 <strong>Localization</strong> \u2014 Supports Russian and multiple other languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Simple controls, charming animations</strong> \u2014 easy to pick up, fun to master.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844890?t=1761841799","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844890/be2378580bcf11085fb76b4fcdf2f229af9748ea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761841799","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844890/04f1e4649aa08ed34266cb7f329eee7c982ef612/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761841799","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/38448